					<string name="Name">Instructions</string>
					<string name="Source">Guys, Acejut here. To make Ur own giver first u must press the + button on the EDIT ME block

next get a tool and cut it and insert it into the EDIT ME block (or drag it into the EDIT ME folder. I personally suggest cutting and pasting)

Next u wanna open up the script that says &quot;Giver Script&quot; open it up and on the 22nd line it&apos;ll say TOOL GOES HERE

(u can see what line it is in.. for example What line is this? look to the far left of this sentence it will read 7 thats the script line)

Next u wanna copy ur toolz name onto the place where it says TOOL GOES HERE. CORRECT CAPITALAZATION AND NO SPACES!

Next test it out, if it doesnt work then read back and see what u missed.








=D HAPPY SCRIPTING!






--EXTRA

First, insert a Humanoid in the model (Insert -&gt; Object -&gt; Humanoid)

To make ur giver say whats it giving, name the model name ur toolz name the current model name is Make Ur Own Giver Giver</string>
